1083:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *   to mVolts.
1084:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *
1085:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Theory:
1086:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  Care must be taken to not exceed the maximum value for a 31 bit signed
1087:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  number in the conversion to uVolts and at the same time not lose resolution.
1088:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *
